WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.915
The policy timeline.

2
00:00:02.276 --> 00:00:06.223
Here are the key provisions in the order you'd meet them, with Arizona's numbers.

3
00:00:07.166 --> 00:00:08.628
It starts at delivery.

4
00:00:08.757 --> 00:00:12.870
Every Arizona life policy gives the owner a free look of at least ten days to

5
00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:14.595
return it for a full refund.

6
00:00:15.049 --> 00:00:17.510
On a replacement, it's thirty days.

7
00:00:17.801 --> 00:00:22.943
Next, if a premium is late, the thirty-day grace period keeps the coverage in force.

8
00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:27.634
If the insured dies during the grace period, the insurer pays the death benefit,

9
00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:29.514
minus the overdue premium.

10
00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:34.228
And if the grace period runs out without payment, the policy lapses.

11
00:00:34.774 --> 00:00:37.432
If the owner elected an automatic premium loan,

12
00:00:37.526 --> 00:00:42.703
the cash value pays the premium instead, or a nonforfeiture option takes over.

13
00:00:43.638 --> 00:00:47.399
After a lapse, the owner can reinstate the policy within three years,

14
00:00:47.423 --> 00:00:49.581
as long as it wasn't surrendered for cash.

15
00:00:49.815 --> 00:00:53.540
They'll need to show evidence of insurability and pay the overdue premiums,

16
00:00:53.564 --> 00:00:56.036
with interest of no more than six percent a year.

17
00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:58.347
Then there are the two-year marks.

18
00:00:58.406 --> 00:01:02.317
Once a policy has been in force for two years during the insured's lifetime,

19
00:01:02.341 --> 00:01:06.710
it becomes incontestable: the insurer can't void it because of misstatements on the

20
00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:07.611
application.

21
00:01:07.903 --> 00:01:10.700
And the suicide exclusion also lasts two years,

22
00:01:10.759 --> 00:01:13.649
measured from issue or reinstatement.

23
00:01:14.599 --> 00:01:18.882
So in order: a ten-day free look, a thirty-day grace period,

24
00:01:19.057 --> 00:01:22.237
three years to reinstate at no more than six percent interest,

25
00:01:22.331 --> 00:01:27.055
and two years until the policy is incontestable and the suicide exclusion ends.

26
00:01:27.718 --> 00:01:32.582
One trap to watch for: the grace period on a life policy is thirty days,

27
00:01:32.815 --> 00:01:36.483
but the conversion period on group life is thirty-one days.
